Subject: [PATCH] Sisong 2.16-3: a new C++ file, and compiling one file on its
 own

The package list names sisong-2.16-3. The owner asked for a New C++ file
option and a compile/link task for a single file: File > New C++ Source,
and Run > Compile This File / Compile and Run This File, which build the
open document on its own with the command in the setting
SingleFileBuildCommand. The editor also asks for JetBrains Mono and Fira
Code (patch 0075) before the system's own monospaced families.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0076-sisong-2-16-3-a-new-c-file-and-compiling-one-file-on-its-own.patch 85f63fbdfab3b5580b75c3f41d21ebcc9d114d11011ce43fb516691be81f2712
